<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Prima ups half yr net distributable income.</title>
<headline>Prima ups half yr net distributable income.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net distributable income	6,655.50    vs   5,324.40</p>
<p>Units in issue qualifying</p>
<p>    for a dividend		  166,387.50    vs 133,110.00</p>
<p>    Dividend per unit (cts)	     4.00    vs	 4.00</p>
<p>Full name: Prima Property Trust (financial-property trust)</p>
<p>Div payable March 21</p>
<p>on register March 7</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
